 "remarks": "In the heart of sought-after Saugatuck, this beautifully curated like-new 2 Bedroom, 2.5 Bath townhome offers effortless, low-maintenance living just a short walk to shops, restaurants, entertainment and the Wesport train station. Bluestone steps lead to a welcoming entry and an open floor plan designed for today's lifestyle, with hardwood floors and abundant natural light throughout. The living room features custom built-ins and a gas fireplace, while the stylish eat-in kitchen is appointed with custom cabinetry, quartz countertops, high-end stainless-steel appliances and a center island. A private, fenced bluestone patio and yard extends the living space outdoors-perfect for morning coffee, al fresco dining, relaxing or entertaining. Upstairs, the spacious primary suite features a walk-in closet with custom white oak shelving and a beautifully finished luxurious bath with a quartz double vanity and tiled shower with a seamless glass door, rainfall shower head, handheld faucet, and stone-topped bench. A second bedroom and full bath complete the upper level. A heated laundry room is conveniently located adjacent to the private garage with easy interior access. Custom Hunter Douglas automated shades provide privacy and decorative appeal. Durable Hardie Board siding enhances the curb appeal while ensuring minimal maintenance. Perfectly positioned to enjoy the best of Westport, this exceptional home is a rare combination of style, privacy, convenience and carefree living.",
